{"title": "Scouting for Kingpins", "pageid": 46877, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Scouting_for_Kingpins", "categories": ["Books", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Book_Generic_G_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Book_Generic_G_Image.png/300px-Book_Generic_G_Image.png.webp, /w/images/4/4e/Book_Generic_G_Image.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Scouting for Kingpins image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Book_Generic_G_Image.png/300px-Book_Generic_G_Image.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4e/Book_Generic_G_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Scouting for Kingpins</b> is a message from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nine-Fingers_Keene\" title=\"Nine-Fingers Keene\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png/25px-Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png/38px-Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png/50px-Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nine-Fingers Keene\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png/25px-Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/56/Portrait_Nine-Fingers_Keene.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nine-Fingers_Keene\" title=\"Nine-Fingers Keene\">Nine-Fingers Keene</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Professor\" title=\"The Professor\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Portrait_The_Professor.png/25px-Portrait_The_Professor.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Portrait_The_Professor.png/38px-Portrait_The_Professor.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Portrait_The_Professor.png/50px-Portrait_The_Professor.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The Professor\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Portrait_The_Professor.png/25px-Portrait_The_Professor.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8c/Portrait_The_Professor.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Professor\" title=\"The Professor\">The Professor</a> describing how she is tapping him to be the next kingpin of Twin Songs.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>This book is redolent with the enticing smell of paper and ink.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\