\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:8b2ae8ea-7a97-4462-b269-94038501f83f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:8b2ae8ea-7a97-4462-b269-94038501f83f\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Professor\" title=\"The Professor\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Portrait_The_Professor.png/25px-Portrait_The_Professor.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Portrait_The_Professor.png/38px-Portrait_The_Professor.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Portrait_The_Professor.png/50px-Portrait_The_Professor.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The Professor\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Portrait_The_Professor.png/25px-Portrait_The_Professor.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8c/Portrait_The_Professor.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Professor\" title=\"The Professor\">The Professor</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Guildhall\" title=\"Guildhall\">Guildhall</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Prof - \n</p><p><br>\nOnce the <a href=\"/wiki/Minsc\" title=\"Minsc\">Stone Lord</a> is taken down, we're going to need to reshuffle the kingpin structure in the outer city - I think everyone but Rael needs to go. Take a tour through the little guildhalls in the outer districts, sound out the enforcers and collectors, and get a feel for who would be both effective and loyal in a leadership role. Do this right and I'm looking at you for the next kingpin of Twin Songs - but if you blow it and set off a succession fight, you're fish food.\n</p><p><br>\n- Nine-Fingers\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714212854\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.059 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.062 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2354/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 38020/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11576/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 933906/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   50.073      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   50.073      1 -total\n 64.91%   32.505     10 Template:Icon_text\n 57.85%   28.966     23 Template:Trim\n 37.24%   18.645      1 Template:PageSeo\n 36.97%   18.510      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 31.66%   15.852      4 Template:CharLink\n 29.64%   14.839      5 Template:Icon_link\n 20.57%   10.299     10 Template:Ifempty\n 20.53%   10.280      2 Template:Uid\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:46877-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714212854 and revision id 336312. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}